	(text "Gate power supply transformer (wound and fitted by hand, not on the BOM): toroid 10/6/4,\ndrawn in the Proteus PDF as a graphic only (no part). Windings as drawn there (dot = start):\n  primary 8t: J1 (dot) - J2\n  HI secondary: 12t J3 (dot) - J4, 4t J4 (dot) - J5\n  LO secondary: 12t J6 (dot) - J7, 4t J7 (dot) - J8\nNote: the rectifier circuit above has J5 / J8 on SOURCE_HI / SOURCE_LO and J4 / J7 on the\nnegative-rail diodes (IPC netlist); the drawing puts J4 / J7 between the 12t and 4t windings.\nPDF labels drv1_vcc / pwm_trans = nets DRV1_VCC / PWM_TRANS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ea0f296-dd41-5a01-8788-1ad2ed34a4a8")
	)
